{
  "steps": [
    {
      "npc": "Greetings human. Do you seek guidance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Who are you?",
          "steps": [
            {
              "player": "Who are you?"
            },
            {
              "npc": "I am Xorrah quo Sihar. I am one of the mystics of the Kahlith."
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "options": [
                {
                  "text": "Kahlith?",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "player": "Kahlith?"
                    },
                    {
                      "npc": "Yes. At one time we were like you, but then we met the Tasakaal. They taught us to have purpose. They taught us to serve the balance."
                    },
                    {
                      "npc": "Our old lives were left behind. In their place, the Kahlith were born."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "choice",
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "text": "Tasakaal?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "player": "Tasakaal?"
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "Our teachers. They showed us the way and taught us to serve the balance."
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "other",
                              "id": "cu4Z5K"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "The balance?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "player": "The balance?"
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "For every death, there must be life. For every life, there must be a death. This is the balance."
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "Our purpose, as taught to us by the Tasakaal, is to keep this balance, no matter the cost."
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "other",
                              "id": "5kYv7L"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "What is this place?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "below",
                              "id": "Lx-jh2"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "That's all thanks.",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "below",
                              "id": "uiBAt_"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "A mystic?",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "player": "A mystic?"
                    },
                    {
                      "npc": "Yes. All Kahlith serve the balance. To do this, we take on one of four roles."
                    },
                    {
                      "npc": "My role is that of a mystic. I learn from the Tasakaal and then pass on their teachings."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "choice",
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "text": "Kahlith?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "above",
                              "id": "sVDfta"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Tasakaal?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "above",
                              "id": "2g4_Z0"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "The balance?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "above",
                              "id": "HRPNiH"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "What is this place?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "below",
                              "id": "uqLeun"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "That's all thanks.",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "below",
                              "id": "obsZH2"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "What is this place?",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "type": "jump",
                      "reference": "below",
                      "id": "ZCgCLI"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "That's all thanks.",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "player": "That's all thanks."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What is this place?",
          "steps": [
            {
              "player": "What is this place?"
            },
            {
              "npc": "This is our home. In your tongue, it is known as Mount Karuulm."
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "options": [
                {
                  "text": "My tongue?",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "player": "My tongue?"
                    },
                    {
                      "npc": "Yes. You speak the language of humans but we Kahlith have our own language."
                    },
                    {
                      "npc": "In the past, we have tried to teach our language to your kind. However, despite the simplicity of our tongue, success was limited."
                    },
                    {
                      "npc": "We find that it is easier to just use your language when your kind are around."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "choice",
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "text": "Kahlith?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "above",
                              "id": "-VdWv8"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Can you give an example?",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "player": "Can you give an example?"
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "Of our language?"
                            },
                            {
                              "player": "Yes please."
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "Well you'll find our language is quite a simple one. Our names are a good example of how it is used."
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "I am Xorrah quo Sihar. The first word, 'Xorrah', is unique to me and it is how I can be identified."
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "The second word, 'quo', is a basic Kahlith word that translates to 'the' in your language."
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "The final word, 'Sihar', is my title. There are four possible titles, one for each role in Kahlith society. My title translates to 'Mystic' in your tongue."
                            },
                            {
                              "player": "So in my language your name would be Xorrah the Mystic?"
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "Exactly."
                            },
                            {
                              "player": "Interesting. Thanks for the information."
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "That's all thanks.",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "jump",
                              "reference": "above",
                              "id": "DWrzeC"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Who are you?",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "type": "jump",
                      "reference": "above",
                      "id": "gLy5Ej"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "That's all thanks.",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "type": "jump",
                      "reference": "above",
                      "id": "ImtXeV"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm good thanks.",
          "steps": [
